---
layout: layout.njk
---

<div class="min-h-screen bg-base-100 text-base-content">
  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="py-12 md:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-semibold leading-tight mb-6">
        Something is off in your organization.<br>You can feel it.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg opacity-80 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
        You've tried frameworks, restructurings, new processes. The real problem is usually simpler — and hiding in plain sight.
      </p>
      <p class="text-lg opacity-80 mb-10 leading-relaxed">
        I help teams find the hidden constraints that keep good organizations from moving where they want to go. Not by adding more. By removing what's in the way.
      </p>
      <div class="mb-12">
        <img src="/assets/images/StartupWorkshop.jpg" alt="Workshop" class="rounded-2xl shadow-sm w-full object-cover max-h-96" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- THREE ELEPHANTS -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-accent">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-12 text-center">Three ideas that change how you see your organization</h2>
      <div class="space-y-10">
        <div class="flex gap-5 items-start">
          <div class="text-primary text-2xl w-10 flex-shrink-0 mt-1 text-center">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-brain"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Brain Budget</h3>
            <p class="opacity-90 leading-relaxed">
              Every brain in your organization is conserving energy. Resistance to change, silo thinking, repeated mistakes — it all makes sense once you see it as energy efficiency in disguise.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-5 items-start">
          <div class="text-primary text-2xl w-10 flex-shrink-0 mt-1 text-center">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-minus"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Via Negativa</h3>
            <p class="opacity-90 leading-relaxed">
              Adding another framework is usually the wrong move. The real leverage is in removing the obstacle — the unnecessary process, the meeting that drains, the constraint nobody named yet.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-5 items-start">
          <div class="text-primary text-2xl w-10 flex-shrink-0 mt-1 text-center">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-question"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Humble Consulting</h3>
            <p class="opacity-90 leading-relaxed">
              I don't walk in with answers. I walk in with questions. The next step is already in the room — it just needs a clear enough question to become visible.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PROOF -->
  <section class="py-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-primary pl-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        <p class="text-lg italic opacity-90 leading-relaxed">Man merkt, dass Nicolas über langjährige Erfahrung im Team-Coaching verfügt. Dadurch war er in der Lage in kurzer Zeit ein sehr gutes Gefühl für die relevanten Themen zu bekommen, an welchen für die Weiterentwicklung unseres neu formierten Teams gearbeitet werden musste.</p>
        <footer class="mt-2 text-sm opacity-60">— André, Führungskraft</footer>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FREE RESOURCES -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-accent">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-6">
        <div class="w-10">{% include "elephant.njk" %}</div>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-4 text-center">Free resources</h2>
      <p class="text-lg opacity-80 mb-8 text-center max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Not ready to talk? Start with the DIY Team Building Game — a year of team development challenges, free and no facilitator required.
      </p>
      <div class="text-center">
        <a href="/resources/" class="text-primary font-semibold hover:underline">
          Browse all resources →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- OFFERS -->
  <section class="py-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-8">How I can help</h2>
      <div class="space-y-6 mb-10">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-1">Consulting Session</h3>
          <p class="opacity-80">You bring a real situation. 90 minutes later, you see your next step.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-1">Change Audit</h3>
          <p class="opacity-80">A week to understand what's really happening beneath the surface. A document you can act on.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-1">Culture Portrait</h3>
          <p class="opacity-80">Know your culture before you change it. A clear picture, no sugar-coating.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <a href="/consulting/" class="text-primary font-semibold hover:underline">Details and pricing →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {% include "footer.njk" %}

</div>
